{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日瘋傳一段影片，有目擊者拍到一名電單車司機駕駛期間，竟然直接將車輛剷上行人路行駛，懷疑是想藉此逃避泊車費用。拍攝者事後將影片上載至網絡，並指事發地點為東涌逸東邨，無奈表示：「這是東涌逸東邨，已有多時這樣，從不阻止」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-16h24m35s865.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026V8Ty4EPWI51790672910.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-16h24m35s865.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-17h00m11s651.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026pInnCeZ7q01790672902.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-29-17h00m11s651.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">相關影片引發大批網民圍觀與撻伐，不少網民批評該行為極其離譜，並指出當時行人路上仍有其他市民正在行走，駕駛者此舉極具危險性，紛紛留言怒轟：「前面有行人，已經構成危險駕駛」、「危險駕駛」，呼籲關注屋苑及行人路的安全隱患。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T02:39:52.887896+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}